# Homepage scope and stack

This repo is HTML + Tailwind (Vite). Do not introduce WordPress, React, or another stack unless the user asks for it.

**Live now:** Home (`index.html`), About (`about.html`), Services hub (`services.html`), and Straight-Shaft Pier Drilling (`services/straight-shaft-pier-drilling.html`), plus same-page jumps and the phone number.

**Stay “coming soon”** until the user says otherwise:

- Remaining individual service pages (Belled, Pool, Home Foundation, Concrete Pour — Explore links stay coming soon)
